    "reason": "customer_request",
    "summary": "Customer Grant Holloway (verified) reports order Q-8201 from Big Slice Pizza never arrived. Courier picked up at 18:05, reported vehicle breakdown at 18:40, and the app auto-marked the order delivered at 18:52 with no handoff recorded. Full refund of $87.55 issued to Visa ending 4242 (RF-4000). Customer asks for someone to investigate why the app marked the order delivered when nothing was received. Customer also wants some extra compensation for the trouble; this was declined under policy (no goodwill compensation)."
   },
   "result": {
