  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "I've passed your concern to a human specialist, reference ESC-700. They'll follow up within 24 hours about why the app marked order Q-8201 as delivered when nothing arrived.\n\nYour full refund of $87.55 is on its way to your Visa ending in 4242, reference RF-4000, and should arrive in 3 to 5 business days.\n\nI'm sorry again for the dinner mix-up. Enjoy the rest of your evening with the kids."
  },
  {
   "role": "customer",
   "text": "Thanks for passing it along, ESC-700 sounds good. I'll watch for the follow-up within 24 hours. Appreciate you getting the refund sorted out. Have a good night."
